</th>
<th style="border: 1px solid #000000;" colspan="1" rowspan="1">
<div><span style="font-size: 10pt;">作业及考核要求/Assignment & Assessment Requirements</span></div>
</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
